  "notes": "No official or unofficial primary committee results are currently posted (the official results PDFs say 'No results reported' and the unofficial page has been replaced by the November 2026 general election), so the evidence is the county's unofficial Republican candidate list. Each precinct has two 'Committeeperson - 4 Yr' seats and the list marks each candidate Male or Female; seats are treated as one male and one female seat. A seat with no filer of that sex is 'empty_no_filer' (write-ins could still have won). Seats with a filed candidate are 'unknown' rather than 'filled' because no result could be verified. Some precincts had more filers than seats (e.g. two male and two female filers). Precinct names are as the list prints them (e.g. 'Kiskiminetas Township - OHN' = Orchard Hills North; 'Ford City Borough - 1' = 1st Ward North)."
}
